# Unit06
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit06核心词汇

dividend/ˈdɪvɪdend/红利/Shareholders received a generous dividend.
division/dɪˈvɪʒn/分割；部门/She works in the marketing division.
document/ˈdɑːkjumənt/文件/Please read the official document carefully.
domestic/dəˈmestɪk/国内的；家庭的/Domestic flights are usually cheaper than international ones.
dominant/ˈdɑːmɪnənt/占主导地位的/English is the dominant language in business.
donate/doʊˈneɪt/捐赠/She donated a large sum to the charity.
dose/doʊs/剂量/Take the medicine in the correct dose.
draft/dræft/草稿/He wrote the first draft of his novel.
drama/ˈdrɑːmə/戏剧/She studied drama at university.
drastic/ˈdræstɪk/激烈的/Drastic measures are needed to solve the problem.
drift/drɪft/漂流/The boat drifted slowly down the river.
drought/draʊt/干旱/The drought destroyed many crops.
due/djuː/到期的；由于/The report is due next Monday.
durable/ˈdjʊrəbl/耐用的/This bag is made of durable material.
duration/djuˈreɪʃn/持续时间/The duration of the flight is three hours.
dynamic/daɪˈnæmɪk/动态的/She is a dynamic and energetic leader.
eager/ˈiːɡər/渴望的/He is eager to learn new skills.
ease/iːz/容易；缓解/The new technology will ease the workload.
economic/ˌiːkəˈnɑːmɪk/经济的/The economic situation has improved.
economy/ɪˈkɑːnəmi/经济/The global economy is slowly recovering.
edition/ɪˈdɪʃn/版本/This is the third edition of the textbook.
editorial/ˌedɪˈtɔːriəl/社论/The newspaper published an editorial on education reform.
elaborate/ɪˈlæbərət/精心制作的/She gave an elaborate presentation.
elect/ɪˈlekt/选举/The people elected a new president.
elegant/ˈelɪɡənt/优雅的/She wore an elegant dress to the party.
element/ˈelɪmənt/元素；因素/Honesty is an important element of friendship.
eliminate/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt/消除/We need to eliminate unnecessary expenses.
embrace/ɪmˈbreɪs/拥抱；接受/She embraced the new challenge with enthusiasm.
emerge/ɪˈmɜːrdʒ/出现/New problems emerged during the discussion.
emergency/ɪˈmɜːrdʒənsi/紧急情况/The government declared a state of emergency.
emission/ɪˈmɪʃn/排放/We must reduce carbon emissions.
emotion/ɪˈmoʊʃn/情绪/She tried to control her emotions.
emphasis/ˈemfəsɪs/强调/The school puts emphasis on practical skills.
empire/ˈempaɪər/帝国/The Roman Empire was once very powerful.
enable/ɪˈneɪbl/使能够/The new system enables faster processing.
encounter/ɪnˈkaʊntər/遇到/We encountered many obstacles along the way.
engage/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒ/从事/She is engaged in scientific research.
enhance/ɪnˈhæns/增强/Technology can enhance the learning experience.
enormous/ɪˈnɔːrməs/巨大的/The project requires an enormous investment.
ensure/ɪnˈʃʊr/确保/Please ensure that all doors are locked.
enterprise/ˈentərpraɪz/企业/He started a small enterprise last year.
enthusiasm/ɪnˈθuːziæzəm/热情/She showed great enthusiasm for the project.
entitle/ɪnˈtaɪtl/给…权利/Every citizen is entitled to free healthcare.
entrepreneur/ˌɑːntrəprəˈnɜːr/企业家/She is a successful entrepreneur.
entry/ˈentri/进入；条目/There is no entry without a pass.
environment/ɪnˈvaɪrənmənt/环境/We must protect the natural environment.
epidemic/ˌepɪˈdemɪk/流行病/The epidemic spread rapidly across the region.
episode/ˈepɪsoʊd/插曲；一集/The first episode of the show was very popular.
equal/ˈiːkwəl/平等的/All people are equal before the law.
equip/ɪˈkwɪp/装备/The lab is equipped with modern instruments.
